Darrin,

It is my understanding that you want the y-axis above the x-axis but you
want 100 near the bottom and 0 at the top.  Here's how I would do this:

plot(0,0,xlim=c(0,Whatever),ylim=c(0,100),type="n",axes=F,xlab="whatever",ylab="depth
in soil")
axis(1,at=seq(0,100,20))
axis(2,at=seq(0,100,20),labels=seq(100,0,-20))
points(x,100-y)

I think this is what you want.  Hope it helps.

JAK

