It 
appears that it is somewhat problematic passing S_FIRST and the like using the 
new batch-bat-files. However the solution that worked for me, was to make a 
.cmd-file (not at .bat-file!), containing the 
following:

 

setlocal
set S_FIRST=library("NovoPlus6_development", 
lib.loc="P:/u99/u99-splus/freeze_test/stats/program/splus", 
first=T)
Splus.bat SBATCH  finalrun.ssc 
endlocal

 

and 
then just run that file - and thus running the finalrun.ssc file in 
batch.

 

/Henrik  

 

 

