Christoph,

You can partition your model by using split with the summary command.

Try: summary(model1, split=list("non+res_vs_sus"=1, "non_vs_res"=2))

Which is how I interpret contrasts(resist) <- cbind(c(1,1,-2),c(-1,1,0))
as meaning compare levels 1 and 2 against level 3 for first df and
compare levels 1 against 2 for the second df.

DaveT.

