Looks like you have a prediction distribution with very long tails (this 
one way that the mean can be outside of the 5% confidence bounds).  If this 
doesn't make sense in the context of the data you are modeling, it 
indicates a potential problem with your modeling approach.  If I were you I 
would look at those bootstrap replications that gave extreme values and try 
to understand why the network did what it did.

-- Tony Plate

