Try ?approx. You'll need to supply an `x' but here's an example to help:

set.seed(1)
n <- 100
y <- sort(rnorm(n))
x <- seq(n)
na <- sample(n, 3) # remove 3 points
guess <- approx(x[-na], y[-na], xout = x[na])$y
cbind(true = y[na], guess)

--sundar

